#: {{hypo|en|lightspeed|speed of light|speed of sound}}
#: {{ux|en|'''Speed''' limits provide information to the drivers about the safe '''speed''' to travel in average conditions.}}
#* {{quote-journal|en|title=Talking of Trains: Recording Electric Operation|journal=[[w:Modern Railways|Trains Illustrated]]|location=London|publisher=w:Ian Allan Publishing|date=1960-12|page=707|issn=0141-9935|oclc=35845948|passage=Train positions and '''speeds''' were established by a track magnet at each milepost, which produced a suitable mark on the punched recording tape whenever a train passed.}}
