# {{lb|en|photography}} The duration of exposure, the time during which a camera shutter is open ([[shutter speed]]).
# {{lb|en|photography}} The largest size of the lens opening at which a lens can be used.
# {{lb|en|photography}} The ratio of the focal length to the diameter of a photographic objective.
