# {{lb|en|slang}} Personal [[preference]].
#: {{ux|en|We could go to the shore next week, or somewhere else if that's not your '''speed'''.}}
#* {{quote-journal|en|date=2024-04-08|author=Nikki Ogunnaike|title=3 Outfit Formulas That Will Carry You Through Any Season|journal=w:[[Marie Claire]]|url=https://www.marieclaire.com/fashion/self-checkout-outfit-formulas/|passage=I used to dream of throwing on the heritage Burberry coat and teaming it with Hunter wellies (which is admittedly a very cute look), but a few years ago I realized an oversize option is actually my '''speed'''.}}
