===Etymology 2===
From {{inh|en|enm|speden}}, from {{inh|en|ang|spēdan||to speed, prosper, succeed, have success}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*spōdijan||to succeed}}. Cognate with {{cog|sco|spede}}, {{m|sco|speid||to meet with success, assist, promote, accomplish, speed}}, {{cog|nl|spoeden||to hurry, rush}}, {{cog|nds|spoden}}, {{m|nds|spöden||to hasten, speed}}, {{cog|de|sputen}}, {{m|de|spuden||to speed}}.

